    "_comment": "Phase 16C scaffold for Wan InfiniteTalk talking-avatar. Requires local model weights NOT installed by default: a Wan 2.x video diffusion model (__VIDEO_MODEL__ via AVATAR_WAN_MODEL_NAME), the InfiniteTalk model_patch (__INFINITETALK_PATCH__ via AVATAR_INFINITETALK_PATCH_NAME), umt5 wan text encoder, a Wan VAE, and a wav2vec2 audio encoder (__AUDIO_ENCODER__ via AVATAR_AUDIO_ENCODER_NAME). Validate node wiring in the ComfyUI editor once the weights are present before enabling AVATAR_BACKEND=comfyui_wan_infinite_talk. This node (key starting with '_') is stripped by the backend sanitizer before submission."
